  "script": "# KI-011: An iodine sink changes induction time without requiring a faster source reaction\n# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.\nregister lv3\nadd v1 water 100mL\nadd v1 H2SO4 0.001mol\nadd v1 KI 0.002mol\nadd v1 H2O2 0.002mol\nadd v1 Na2S2O3 0.0001mol\nnew\nadd v2 water 100mL\nadd v2 H2SO4 0.001mol\nadd v2 KI 0.002mol\nadd v2 H2O2 0.002mol\nadd v2 Na2S2O3 0.0002mol\nwait 10s\nmeasure v1 uvvis\nmeasure v2 uvvis\ninspect\nwait 30s\nmeasure v1 uvvis\nmeasure v2 uvvis\ninspect\nwait 60s\ninspect\n",
